cut command
------------
-If i want to fetch the 5th line so we use cut command.

[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cat > data.txt
java|2000|language
mysql|5000|database
oracle|4000|database
python|3000|langauge
django|3000|language

Extracts the 5th character from each line.(cut -c 5 data.txt)
-------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -c 5 data.txt
|
l
l
o
g

Extracts characters from the 5th to the 8th position(cut -c 5-8 data.txt)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -c 5-8 data.txt
|200
l|50
le|4
on|3
go|3

Extracts characters from the 5th position to the end of the line(cut -c 5- data.txt)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -c 5- data.txt
|2000|language
l|5000|database
le|4000|database
on|3000|langauge
go|3000|language

Extracts the 5th, 7th, and 8th characters.(cut -c 5,7,8 data.txt)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -c 5,7,8 data.txt
|00
l50
l|4
o|3
g|3

Extracts the 5th, 7th, and characters from the 8th to 12th position.(cut -c 5,7,8-12 data.txt )
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -c 5,7,8-12 data.txt
|000|la
l5000|d
l|4000|
o|3000|
g|3000|


Extracts the 1st field, using | as the delimiter.(cut -d '|' -f 1 data.txt)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -d '|' -f 1 data.txt
java
mysql
oracle
python
django

Extracts the 2nd and 3rd fields.(cut -d '|' -f 2-3 data.txt)
-------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -d '|' -f 2-3 data.txt
2000|language
5000|database
4000|database
3000|langauge
3000|language

Extracts the 2nd field to the end of the line.(cut -d '|' -f 2- data.txt)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -d '|' -f 2- data.txt
2000|language
5000|database
4000|database
3000|langauge
3000|language

Extracts the first to the third field(cut -d '|' -f -3 data.txt )
-----------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -d '|' -f -3 data.txt
java|2000|language
mysql|5000|database
oracle|4000|database
python|3000|langauge
django|3000|language

Extracts the 1st, 3rd, and 5th fields.(cut -d '|' -f 1,3,5 data.txt)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -d '|' -f 1,2,3 data.txt
java|2000|language
mysql|5000|database
oracle|4000|database
python|3000|langauge
django|3000|language

Complement/skip
---------------
cat > data1.txt
01|Akash|7665444445|ghadai@gmail.com|BBSR

-If you want hide/skip mobline number show others details .
-Mob column is 3
cut -d '|' --complement -f 3 data1.txt
----------------------------------------
[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -d '|' --complement -f 3 data1.txt
01|Akash|ghadai@gmail.com|BBSR

Extracts all fields except the 3rd and 5th(cut -d '|' --complement -f3,5 data.txt )
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Original(01|Akash|7665444445|ghadai@gmail.com|BBSR)

[ec2-user@ip-172-31-1-83 ~]$ cut -d '|' --complement -f3,5 data1.txt
01|Akash|ghadai@gmail.com

Extracts all fields except the 3rd to 5th(cut -d '|' --complement –f 3-5 data.txt)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cut -d '|' --complement –f 3-5 data.txt

Extracts all fields except the 3rd to the end(cut -d '|' --complement –f 3- data.txt)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cut -d '|' --complement –f 3- data.txt

Extracts all fields except the first to the 5th(cut -d '|' --complement -f-5 data.txt)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cut -d '|' --complement -f-5 data.txt







